11
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:54,650
Writing Task 2 – Task Response.

12
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:58,290
For this criterion, your essay is marked 

13
00:00:58,290 --> 00:01:02,170
based on how well you fulfil all the requirements of the question.

14
00:01:03,129 --> 00:01:07,290
Specifically, examiners will check if any ideas are off-topic,

15
