155
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:54,640
Children spending most of their day at school

156
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:58,400
and busier parents leads to school's heavy influence.

157
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:04,540
Because of this heavy influence, elaboration, lessons on

158
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:09,360
behaviors can create positive relationships among children, 

159
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,800
a safe and supporting learning environment.

160
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:16,020
To illustrate the explanation, I have an example.

161
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:20,340
Schools with regular workshops on respect leads to

162
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:23,600
students treating their friends nicely and not bullying.

163
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:28,420
After improving, we have a new outline for body two like this.

164
00:11:34,330 --> 00:11:37,330
To sum up, we have three steps to

165
00:11:37,330 --> 00:11:41,550
select the main ideas, explanations and examples for the outline.

166
00:11:42,330 --> 00:11:45,190
Please put the following steps in the correct order.

167
00:11:48,110 --> 00:11:51,330
Let's move on to the last part of the outline, the conclusion.

168
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:53,570
Three, conclusion.

169
00:11:54,350 --> 00:11:58,910
To have a band 6.0 conclusion, we need to fulfill two tasks.

170
00:12:00,090 --> 00:12:03,810
Opinion restatement and summary of main ideas.

171
00:12:04,330 --> 00:12:09,300
In the the conclusion already fulfilled both of these tasks successfully.

172
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:13,120
In conclusion, schools have to be responsible for

173
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:16,060
teaching about good manners because children spend 

174
