178
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:34,000
Children spend a lot of time at school and education costs are paid by parents.

179
00:12:35,180 --> 00:12:37,860
However, because we've changed the outline of the

180
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:41,060
introduction and body, so to make sure the

181
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:43,900
