183
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,960
Improved conclusion.

184
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:55,080
In the opinion restatement, we can write in the outline as follows.

185
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:56,020
Agree.

186
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:58,860
Schools should provide behavioral education.

187
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:04,960
In the summary of main ideas, we adapt it to the two main ideas in the essay.

188
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:12,100
Schools are not entirely responsible, but the impact of schools on students manners is significant.

189
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:15,960
Now, let's wrap up what we've learned today.

190
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:24,210
Hey guys, today we've learned about agree and

191
00:13:24,210 --> 00:13:26,850
disagree questions and how to achieve a band

192
00:13:26,850 --> 00:13:31,250
6.0 plus in which criterion of writing task 2.

193
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:32,970
Is it A.

194
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:34,450
Lexical resource.

195
00:13:35,190 --> 00:13:35,590
B.

196
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:36,810
Task response.

197
00:13:37,890 --> 00:13:38,310
C.

