00:13:51,210 --> 00:13:54,630
The correct answer is task response.

201
00:13:55,350 --> 00:13:59,110
So, with the agree or disagree essay, 

202
00:13:59,110 --> 00:14:01,610
would we achieve higher scores if we only write

203
00:14:01,610 --> 00:14:05,130
about one side or develop ideas for both sides?

204
00:14:05,990 --> 00:14:11,250
Remember to write about both sides, but choose one side to support more.

205
00:14:12,170 --> 00:14:15,470
