00:14:16,330 --> 00:14:19,990
For the introduction, write a general statement by

207
00:14:19,990 --> 00:14:21,430
paraphrasing the question.

208
00:14:22,170 --> 00:14:24,470
Remind the reader about the topic of the essay.

209
00:14:25,290 --> 00:14:29,850
Ensure that the thesis statement states the writer's opinion on the given topic.

210
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:34,250
For body paragraphs, step one in the thesis statement,

211
00:14:34,250 --> 00:14:37,510
identify which side you will support more

