00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:39,430
and develop it in body 2.

213
00:14:40,010 --> 00:14:42,430
Write about the other side in body 1.

214
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:46,230
Step two, based on the table of brainstormed ideas, 

