00:14:46,230 --> 00:14:50,530
choose the suitable ones to develop each of the main ideas.

216
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:56,650
Step three, provide an example to specify each idea chosen above.

217
00:14:57,770 --> 00:15:02,590
For conclusion, opinion restatement and summary of main ideas.

218
00:15:03,230 --> 00:15:06,430
Now, goodbye and see you in the next lesson.

